  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0: first stable release. One awaitable, cancellable Send API; typed configuration (LiteRtBackend, LiteRtCache, LiteRtSamplerParams); function calling; multimodal image/audio including restored multi-turn history; tokenizer surface; speculative decoding and benchmark APIs; Microsoft.Extensions.AI (IChatClient) and Semantic Kernel companion packages. Breaking changes from the 0.1.0 previews are listed in the CHANGELOG. Built against LiteRT-LM v0.13.1. Full notes: https://github.com/OrihuelaConde/LiteRtLmSharp/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
